  "narrative": "<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Short impact summary</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Vorgeschichten in Archäologischen Landesmuseen (2023), published by Transcript-Verlag, has no recorded citations, downloads or public discussion yet. This is an early record rather than a quiet one — the signals collected for it so far are thin.</p>\n<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Full narrative</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Vorgeschichten in Archäologischen Landesmuseen by Tabea Malter was published by Transcript-Verlag in 2023. It is part of the Edition Museum series. Conceptually, the work connects to Arch, Geology, Geography and Archaeology.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">OpenAlex records no citations for the book so far.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">It has been downloaded 9 times via Ubiquity Press. Its subject matter aligns with Sustainable cities and communities among the Sustainable Development Goals.</p>",
